# 수정주가 관리 정기 점검: detect → 제한적 recheck (최대 5종목, KIS 요청 최대 10건). DB 쓰기 없음.
# resync-plan·resync-apply·resync-restore는 여기서 실행하지 않는다 (사람이 결과를 보고 실행).
# 보류(hold) 종목과 SOURCE_DISCONTINUITY 종목은 recheck가 상태 파일을 보고 건너뛴다.
# 설치: ~/.config/systemd/user/ 에 복사 → systemctl --user daemon-reload → systemctl --user enable --now memos-adjusted-price-check.timer
[Unit]
Description=MEMO'S adjusted price check (detect + limited KIS recheck, no DB writes)
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
WorkingDirectory=/home/sd1-10/projects/AI_investment_memo
Environment=PYTHONPATH=/home/sd1-10/projects/AI_investment_memo/backend
Environment=TZ=Asia/Seoul
ExecStart=/home/sd1-10/projects/AI_investment_memo/.venv/bin/python scripts/adjusted_price_manager.py detect
ExecStart=/home/sd1-10/projects/AI_investment_memo/.venv/bin/python scripts/adjusted_price_manager.py recheck --max-symbols 5 --max-requests 10
StandardOutput=append:/home/sd1-10/projects/AI_investment_memo/logs/market/adjusted_price_check.log
StandardError=append:/home/sd1-10/projects/AI_investment_memo/logs/market/adjusted_price_check.log
TimeoutStartSec=30min
Nice=10
